Error [jet.EmptyPrint]: `#Root` must mark the first parameter
  --> tests/ui/root_param_shape.jet:1:27
    |
  1 | bad: fn(after: Int, #Root value: Int) {
    |                           ^^^^^
 Why: A reversible dot call has one receiver, and it is always the first value parameter
 Fix: Move `#Root` to the first parameter
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0103

Error [jet.EmptyPrint]: `#Root` must mark a bare-read parameter
  --> tests/ui/root_param_shape.jet:5:21
    |
  5 | also_bad: fn(#Root &value: Int) {
    |                     ^^^^^
 Why: Dot-call syntax never hides write access or a move behind the receiver
 Fix: Remove the write mark `&` or the take mark `&&` from the `#Root` parameter
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0103
